          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "eco-friendly",
            "title": "Grooming Care",
            "text": "<p>Grooming at home can be daunting. Learn the basics that will keep your dog healthy and clean.</p><p>Safe Nail Cutting</p><p>Effective Baths</p><p>Ear Cleaning</p><p>Brushing and Combing</p><p>Cooperative Care</p><p>& More</p><p></p>"
          }
        },
