          }
        },
        "41d616c3-2224-4f58-b794-20d02f788224": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "heart",
            "title": "Increased Safety",
            "text": "<p>For fearful, aggressive or shy dogs, virtual dog training can be a lot less frightening than an unfamiliar environment with unknown people and dogs. By training in your dog’s “safe space”, you are making the process less overwhelming for them (and you!) </p>"
          }
        },
        "378c64ed-8360-479a-818b-274a1dbd6371": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "eco-friendly",
            "title": "Anywhere, Anytime Support",
            "text": "<p>With our 24/7 messaging support, you’ll get experts on call to help calm any puppy blues and/or analyze your training progress. Why wait between sessions when you can get the support you need daily.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cff8bb63-a14d-4801-b95a-e391b0b6f670": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "award",
            "title": "Guaranteed Results",
            "text": "<p>If you are not satisfied with what you learned in the programs, we will continue to train with you for 4 more weeks free of cost.</p>"
          }
        },
        "2dc52604-a9da-485a-862c-13dcbedadbcd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "clock",
            "title": "Get Ahead of the Problem",
            "text": "<p>With virtual, you can start as early as 8-weeks (instead of the typical 16), ensuring that your dog is beginning training during their prime weeks of learning and development. </p>"
          }
        },
        "af90b4af-932d-4481-b23d-21c04cb61b49": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "icon_name": "smile",
            "title": "Get the Family Involved",
            "text": "<p>Don’t let schedules get in the way of everyone training. With virtual calls and an extensive video library, the whole family can get involved wherever they are.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
