    "2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is virtual dog training?",
            "text": "<p>Virtual dog training is quickly becoming the most effective training method to get long-term results. Through weekly 1:1 video calls with your dedicated trainer, we demonstrate the training techniques and watch as you practice in real time with your pup. After each call, we'll provide homework and video lessons to track your progress. Still curious? Watch a sample virtual training lesson <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/-8r8SWmgQ6mGu0nIMQoO0KB48bJeKRwbhImxJ_eJbkJmAVQstrWW-CwiqVOlv9bO1XaggZc-7wdj10103TwdJQ/https/www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a> &gt;</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your training philosophy?",
            "text": "<p>We are proud to stand behind positive-reinforcement training practices, the most powerful tool recognized by PETA, the ASPCA, and the Humane Society of America to transform your pup’s behavior. All of our trainers are force-free certified experts ensuring that the techniques you learn are promoting a positive and healthy relationship between you and your pup. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you guarantee that my dog will improve?",
            "text": "<p>We are 100% committed to your success. Our unique 7-day satisfaction guarantee gives you the confidence to get started without the risk. After your program has concluded, if you're not fully satisfied, we will continue training with you for 4 more weeks. </p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16059996111034__2bbeb69d-ad3b-4b68-a947-a42915622081-16857354447286f141-3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who are your trainers?",
            "text": "<p>Our trainers are some of the best in the country with Fear Free™ certifications from institutions such as The University of Washington Animal Behavior College, Karen Pryor Academy, Cambridge Institute of Canine Behaviour, Training and Brenda Aloff Fundamentals, and more. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_mFhVPi": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much time do you spend with my dog?",
            "text": "<p>With Homeschool, YOU become the expert in training your dog throughout the program and beyond. It takes 1,000 repetitions to shape a dog’s behavior – which is why outside of our 1:1 video sessions we check-in daily via text and are available for any questions so you can get faster results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_8kTVEd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does online dog training actually work?",
            "text": "<p>We’ve worked with pet parents across the country to transform their dog’s behavior from complex reactivity issues to puppy training, the <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/eeU_0HM1yBmykb6BMUt4kvI5Y9JJqzvM70XERtK0ytjfA98XIpYTk1yu-xKRc9B1yW29Km2EIGnDZ_ZfOpcq7w/https/www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">dozens of video reviews</span></a> we have speak for themselves.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_6kWqNB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this right for my dog?",
            "text": "<p>We’ve trained dogs of all shapes and sizes. With our vast training network, we match you with the trainer who has the qualifications, specialties and advanced degrees to tackle it. Whether you're trying to work through one problem or a few, we will carefully customize a program to meet your needs. Scheduling a behavior evaluation call is the best way to get real advice from a dog expert to feel confident in beginning your training journey. <br/></p><p><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_ifwpmf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you train?",
            "text": "<p>Science has proven that the best environment for your pup to learn is without distractions. Training outside of the home brings not only new smells but new people and other dogs to get excited about which breaks your dog’s focus and slows down the behavior modification process. That’s why we only offer virtual training at home so you and your pup can make progress together ASAP. </p><p></p>"
          }
        },
        "text_4Gmwif": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What does it cost?",
            "text": "<p>We have a several options depending on your budget and how much you're looking to solve at one time. One full week's worth of premium training & support is $125, which includes 3 sessions (1 intensive training and 2 mini practice sessions).</p><p>Tight on a budget? We also offer text training for $25 / week and self-paced courses. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
